From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 22:52:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 17/43] cef: include portable POSIX startup utility on AROS

CEF's Alloy and Chrome delegates call util_linux::PreSandboxStartup on every POSIX target. Compile the implementation on AROS without importing the Linux native-window or fontconfig branches.

AI_PHASE: chromium-shared-cef

AI_STATUS: exact-link-gap-fixed-under-validation

AI_VALIDATION: registered native link contained the sole unresolved util_linux::PreSandboxStartup symbol

AI_LIMITATIONS: CEF archive rebuild and native link remain pending

AI_EVIDENCE: aros-opal-hosted-clean/test-artifacts/-cef-zero-v8-native-link-20260725/04-undefined-symbols.txt

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:
